  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$f^{\\prime}(x)=2 x+x \\cos x+\\sin x+\\sin x=2(x+\\sin x)+x \\cos x$\n$\\Rightarrow f^{\\prime}(x) > 0 \\quad \\forall x > 0, \\quad f^{\\prime}(x)  < 0 \\quad \\forall x < 0 \\Rightarrow f(0)=-1$<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/wbjee/6lWKwjS99W4DsQpgke3d5yfY-t6on1RTAXyZ4WA73qg.original.fullsize.png\">",
